    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="47">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 47</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XCI} Gif mon forstolenne ceap befehð, ne mot hine mon tieman to ðeowum men.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone captures stolen livestock, a slave cannot be vouched to warranty for it.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a stolen chattel is attached, a slave may not be vouched to warranty for it.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon forstolenne ceap befehð, ne mot hine mon tymon to þeowan men.</ab>
      </div>
